DTSTAMP:20261029T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261106T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261106T190000
SUMMARY:Season of Light planetarium show at Pensacola State College
LOCATION:Pensacola State College Planetarium\, 1000 College Blvd\, Building
  21\, Pensacola\, FL 32504
DESCRIPTION:Friday 11/6 · 6:00 PM\n\nThis 35-minute planetarium program tr
 aces the winter customs of light\, from Christian and Jewish holidays to C
 eltic\, Nordic\, Roman\, Mexican and Hopi traditions. It also covers winte
 r constellations and why the seasons change. A live narrated night sky pre
 sentation follows\, so plan on about an hour inside.\n\nPrice: from $4\n\n
 Details: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-psc-season-of-light-planet
 arium-1106.html
