UID:ev_kids_night_out_mess_hall_1120-2026-11-20@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261029T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261205
SUMMARY:Kids Night Out at the Pensacola MESS Hall
LOCATION:Pensacola MESS Hall\, 418 E Wright Street\, Pensacola\, FL 32501
DESCRIPTION:Friday 11/20 · 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM · Friday 12/4 · 6:00 PM to
  8:00 PM\n\nThe Pensacola MESS Hall gives parents a Friday night off on No
 vember 20 and December 4. Kids in grade 1 and up spend two hours on hands-
 on science\, games and cheese pizza. A child with a different meal in mind
  can bring one\, and everyone should bring a water bottle.\n\nPrice: from 
